##### Hierarchy

| Role | Font | Size | Weight | Line Height | Letter Spacing | Notes |
|------|------|------|--------|-------------|----------------|-------|
| Display | system-ui | 32px (2rem) | 600 | 1.25 | -0.01em | Repo header, marketing hero |
