| Body Long 01 | IBM Plex Sans | 16px (1.00rem) | 400 (Regular) | 1.50 (24px) | 0 | Standard reading text |
| Body Long 02 | IBM Plex Sans | 16px (1.00rem) | 600 (Semibold) | 1.50 (24px) | 0 | Emphasized body, labels |
