| Name | Width | Key Changes |
|------|-------|-------------|
| Small (sm) | 320px | Single column, hamburger nav, 16px margins |
| Medium (md) | 672px | 2-column grids begin, expanded content |
| Large (lg) | 1056px | Full navigation visible, 3-4 column grids |
