| Level | Treatment | Use |
|-------|-----------|-----|
| Level 0 (Void) | No shadow, `#07080a` surface | Page background |
| Level 1 (Subtle) | `rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.28) 0px 1.189px 2.377px` | Minimal lift, inline elements |
