#### 5. Layout Principles

##### Spacing System
- Base unit: 8px
- Scale: 1px, 2px, 4px, 8px, 10px, 12px, 16px, 20px, 24px, 32px, 44px, 48px, 80px, 100px, 120px
- Button/badge padding: 2px 8px (compact)
