#### 6. Depth & Elevation

| Level | Treatment | Use |
|-------|-----------|-----|
| Flat (Level 0) | No shadow, no border | Page background, text blocks |
| Contained (Level 1) | `1px solid rgba(0,0,0,0.08)` (light) or `rgba(255,255,255,0.12)` (dark) | Cards, badges, containers |
