| Value | Use When |
|-------|----------|
| `scope="col"` | Header applies to column below |
| `scope="row"` | Header applies to row beside it |
| `scope="colgroup"` | Header spans multiple columns |
| `scope="rowgroup"` | Header spans multiple rows |

